    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Wireframe Your Data Page and Cards\r\n\r\nIn this level, you’ll plan how your dataset will appear in your app.\r\n\r\n## Do This:\r\n\r\n- Create a wireframe of your full page layout.\r\n- Include a header/title, description area, card section, and placeholders for future controls.\r\n- Create a wireframe of one data card.\r\n- Label where each schema field will appear on the card.\r\n- Use arrows or notes to connect schema fields to UI labels if helpful.\r\n\r\nKeep your wireframes simple using boxes, labels, and arrows rather than detailed artwork.\r\n\r\nThis will help you prepare to render your dataset with `.map()` in the next level.",
